WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.330
Welcome back to My Little Pony and Friends.

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:53.110
Take food from Baby Fifi. Mmm, tasty good.

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:03.560
See, Milkweed? Nice!

00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:50.640
Kitty Split were ice cream.

00:03:01.560 --> 00:03:07.780
Ripple has shut down the Mixville Ice Cream Works to drive Fudgy McSwain out of business.

00:03:07.780 --> 00:03:09.500
Fudgy who?

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:16.000
Fudgy McSwain. He runs the Creamy Confection Foundry. He makes all the ice cream toppings in Ponyland.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:21.700
They really hate each other. And the saddest thing is, they used to be such good friends.

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:27.460
Then there's only one thing to do. We're gonna make those two friends again.

00:03:27.460 --> 00:03:30.000
Come on!

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:49.600
Bunchy McSwain's a thief!

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:53.030
I'd spent...

00:03:53.030 --> 00:03:54.340
Long way!

00:03:54.340 --> 00:03:57.330
I'd spent years developing my greatest ice cream flavor!

00:03:57.330 --> 00:04:00.000
Double banana, marshmallow, colada...

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:05.180
On the day I'm ready to start making my greatest creation,

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:08.780
the piece of paper with the recipe disappears!

00:04:08.780 --> 00:04:11.780
And Fudgy McSwain took it!

00:04:11.780 --> 00:04:22.540
Foundry. Fudgy McSwain listened to us.

00:04:22.540 --> 00:04:26.020
No! Why should I crawl to him?

00:04:26.020 --> 00:04:28.520
It's me that's owed the apology.

00:04:28.520 --> 00:04:30.000
But Rocky Ripple...

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:47.180
Right then, I'll speak to my old friend and set things straight for you ponies.

00:04:47.180 --> 00:05:00.000
So you see, Rocky, I could never have taken the recipe. Without your ice cream, I'd be out of business, and I'd be willing to help you look for it, old friend!

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:20.860
friend you pretend to be my friend so you can abuse me in this way now see here

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:30.000
see how you like it when you're up to your eyeballs in butterscotch shopping

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:47.380
I'll teach him a lesson he'll nay soon forget

00:06:31.210 --> 00:06:37.350
We better warn Rocky.

00:06:37.350 --> 00:06:44.730
Rocky Ripple, you swing!

00:06:44.730 --> 00:06:56.440
You not yet better fight!

00:07:02.970 --> 00:07:03.560
Boys!

00:08:06.810 --> 00:08:09.250
I'm saving this for a special occasion.

00:08:09.250 --> 00:08:11.750
It's the very last ice cream I have.

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:15.930
Oh, it's there. Everything all right?

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:20.580
I have some nice ice cream.

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:25.320
You still, Queen?

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:33.340
Rocky didn't steal it!

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:37.340
Rocky must have gotten careless and dropped it in the ice cream mixture!

00:08:37.340 --> 00:08:41.170
Come on, gang! We're gonna put a stop to this silliness!

00:08:41.170 --> 00:08:50.330
You're a marshmallow maniac! I'll stop you if it's the last thing I do!

00:08:50.330 --> 00:08:54.580
Aye, and it'll be the last thing you do!

00:09:29.560 --> 00:09:30.000
What are you saying?

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:33.270
I do get confused once in a while.

00:09:33.270 --> 00:09:36.720
Well, Fudgy, looks like I owe you an apology.

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:41.020
Can you ever forgive me, old friend?

00:09:41.020 --> 00:09:45.200
Of course, if you can forgive me.

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:48.570
Now that's more like it.

00:09:48.570 --> 00:09:51.570
I'll start making ice cream again right away.

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:55.820
Aye, but what's ice cream without toppings, me old chum?

00:09:55.820 --> 00:09:59.960
Ha ha ha, we're back in business again.

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:05.080
And to show you, First Tooth Ponies, how grateful we are,

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:09.350
you can have all the ice cream you want for free!

00:10:09.350 --> 00:10:23.190
Giving for nice salad.

00:10:23.190 --> 00:10:26.120
Ha ha ha ha!

00:11:02.840 --> 00:11:03.400
Thank you.
